      "text": "REPRESENTATIONS OF HECKE — 16 sections: Front matter; INTRODUCTION; ILL Links and Braids\n\n**REPRESENTATIONS OF HECKE**\n\n*ALGEBRAS AND THE*\n\n58 pp, 16 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; I INTRODUCTION; ILL Links and Braids; II 2. Representations of the Braid Group and t; II 3. The Temperley-Lieb Algebra; IIA. Diagram Algebras; III SCHUR-WEYL DUALITY AND QUOTIENTS OF THE HE; III 2. Representations of the Iwahori-Hecke Al; IlI.3. The Quantum Group Uv (.6'[(2)); IlIA. The Quantum Supergroup Uv (g[(111)); IV A STATE-SUM FORMULA FOR THE ALEXANDER POLYN; IV 2. Construction of the State-sum; IV 3. An Example; V COMBINATORIAL PROOF; V.l. Braid Group Invariance; V.2. Markov JVloves",
